{'symbol': 'NI', 'date': '2022-02-23 06:30:00', 'title': 'NISOURCE REPORTS FOURTH QUARTER 2021 RESULTS', 'text': 'MERRILLVILLE, IND., FEB. 23, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NISOURCE INC. (NYSE: NI) TODAY ANNOUNCED, ON A GAAP BASIS, NET INCOME AVAILABLE TO COMMON SHAREHOLDERS FOR THE THREE MONTHS ENDED DECEMBER\xa031, 2021 OF $152.2 MILLION, OR $0.36 DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE, COMPARED TO NET INCOME AVAILABLE TO COMMON SHAREHOLDERS OF $70.7 MILLION, OR $0.18 DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE, FOR THE SAME PERIOD OF 2020.'}